  "solution": "Given:\n\n((3+frac{3)/(2)÷6(1)/(2)times (1)/(3) ) of 4(1)/(3)}{(-(8)/(3)÷2)}\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9fd9d79ef26104459e361c252b0ac31f9c806e499b13ef56a436c9416ede55e2.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n((3+frac{3)/(2)÷6(1)/(2)× (1)/(3) ) of 4(1)/(3)}{(-(8)/(3)÷2)}\n\n⇒ ((3+frac{3)/(2)times(2)/(13)× (1)/(3) ) of(13)/(3)}{(-(8)/(3)times {1over2})}\n\n⇒ ((3+frac{1)/(13) ) of(13)/(3)}{(-(4)/(3))}\n\n⇒ (frac{40)/(13) times (13)/(3)}{-(4)/(3)}\n\n⇒ (40/3)/(-4/3)\n\n⇒ -10\n\n**∴ The value of ((3+frac{3)/(2)÷6(1)/(2)× (1)/(3) ) of 4(1)/(3)}{(-(8)/(3)÷2)} is -10.**\n\nf",
